        "vendor/editorial-magazine-explainer-producer/references/revision-qa-and-closure.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "V26",
      "text": "用户要求青年明亮音但仍使用未处理原声，或处理造成母钟漂移；",
      "source_line": 390,
      "enforcement": "真实媒体/结构校验加对应视听或语义审核；不能用布尔值替代实际证据",
      "references": [
        "skills/magazine-production/references/quality-contract.md",
        "vendor/editorial-magazine-explainer-producer/references/revision-qa-and-closure.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "V27",
      "text": "无明确理由缺少背景音乐，或音乐压住口播；",
